  "instructions": [
    "Sauté olive oil in a large pot until hot.",
    "Add diced onion and minced garlic, cooking until translucent.",
    "Stir in smoked paprika, cumin, salt, pepper and bay leaf, cooking for 1 minute.",
    "Add smoked turkey, cooked beans and vegetable broth, bringing to a gentle boil.",
    "Reduce heat, cover and simmer for 30 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Uncover, sprinkle shredded cheese over the top, cover again and let the cheese melt for 5 minutes.",
    "Remove the pot from heat and stir in fresh cilantro and lime juice.",
    "Let the casserole rest for 5 minutes before serving.",
    "Serve hot with crusty bread or rice."
